  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_instruction\"><img style=\"float:left;width:20px;height:20px;\" src=\"/api/static/gifs/calculator_not.svg\" alt=\"Calculatrices interdites\" >\t<strong>La calculatrice n'est pas autorisée.</strong></div>\t<div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Le volume \\(V\\) d’un cylindre de hauteur \\(h\\) et de rayon \\(r\\) est égal à&nbsp;&#63; <div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(V=\\pi r^2 h\\)</div> On cherche à isoler <span class=\"nowrap\">\\(h\\).</span> On a&nbsp;&#58;\t  <div class=\"wimscenter wims_scrollable\">\t  <table class=\"wimsborder\"><tr><th>\t  A. </th><th>B. </th><th> C.</th><th> D.\t  </th></tr>\t  <tr><td>\\(h=\\frac{r^2}{\\pi V}\\) </td><td>\\(h=\\frac{\\pi r^2}{V}\\) </td><td>\\(h=\\sqrt{\\frac{V}{\\pi r^2}}\\) </td><td>\\(h=\\frac{V}{\\pi r^2}\\) </td></tr>\t  </table>\t  </div>\t  <div class=\"wimscenter\">\t  <b>   </b>\t  </div>\t</div>",
